        "transcript": "Hey, I just got a message from Jake. He can't make it to the rock concert tonight, so I've got an extra ticket. Oh no, that's too bad. What time does it start? 8 p.m. at the Riverside Arena. I was thinking of posting it on the campus bulletin board, but I'd rather go with someone I know. Actually, I've been wanting to see that band for months. If you're offering, I'd love to go. Perfect. Let's meet at the main gate around 7.30 so we can grab dinner first.",
