        "verdict": "PASS",
        "wer": 0.0,
        "backend": "faster_whisper",
        "reason": "WER 0.0%",
        "transcript": "Thank you for your participation today. I'd like to ask you some questions about exercise. Can you share one or two ways that you or people you know try to stay physically active?",
